[00:40.12] I remember your song
[00:44.64] And the way you sang it to me
[00:51.68] So many times in other forms
[00:57.58] On distant lands.
[01:33.48] I remember your smile
[01:37.74] And the way you sent it to me
[01:44.94] So many times through different air
[01:50.24] It lives inside my heart.
[02:00.08] It is a dream
[02:03.58] You and me
[02:07.84] It can't be real
[02:15.06] I never felt a wind
[02:16.84] So happy, so warm
[02:27.92] That sent seven little red birds up my spine
[02:32.24] Singing...
